# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.gpu.csf.Context version 1
call info() -> Info
call createVM(userRange: UInt64) throws(GPUError) -> VMInfo
call destroyVM(vm: UInt32) throws(GPUError)
call createBuffer(size: UInt64, flags: UInt32) throws(GPUError) -> Buffer
call destroyBuffer(id: UInt32) throws(GPUError)
call bind(
    vm: UInt32,
    buffer: UInt32,
    offset: UInt64,
    size: UInt64,
    address: UInt64,
    flags: UInt32
) throws(GPUError)
call unbind(vm: UInt32, address: UInt64, size: UInt64) throws(GPUError)
call createGroup(vm: UInt32, queues: [QueueConfig], priority: UInt32)
  throws(GPUError) -> UInt32
call destroyGroup(group: UInt32) throws(GPUError)
call groupState(group: UInt32) throws(GPUError) -> GroupState
call addSync(counter: Handle) throws(GPUError) -> UInt32
call removeSync(id: UInt32)
call submit(
    group: UInt32,
    jobs: [Job],
    waits: [SyncValue],
    signals: [SyncValue]
) throws(GPUError)
```

# DESCRIPTION

Protocol `todhchai.gpu.csf.Context`, version 1, of library `GPUCSFIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
